#: ../../source/users/schema/picture.rst:5
msgid "Working with pictures"
msgstr "图片工作"

#: ../../source/users/schema/picture.rst:7
msgid ""
"QElectroTech allows adding and working with pictures at `folios`_. The "
"format from the picture should be **PNG**, **JPG**, **JPEG**, **SVG** or "
"**Bitmap**."
msgstr ""
"QElectroTech 允许在 `图幅 <folios_>`_ 上添加和工作图片，图片的格式应为 **PNG**, **JPG**, "
"**JPEG**, **SVG** 或 **Bitmap**."

#: ../../source/users/schema/picture.rst:13
msgid "Figure: Cover Arduino project"
msgstr "图：覆盖Arduino项目"

#: ../../source/users/schema/picture.rst:16
msgid "Add picture"
msgstr "添加图片"

#: ../../source/users/schema/picture.rst:18
msgid ""
"Select the icon |insert-image| from `toolbar`_ to open the search file PopUP"
" window."
msgstr "从 `工具栏 <toolbar_>`_ 选择图标 |insert-image| 打开搜索文件 PopUP 窗口。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/picture.rst:23
msgid "insert-image"
msgstr "插入图像"

#: ../../source/users/schema/picture.rst:19
msgid "Select the picture at the corresponding directory."
msgstr "在相应的目录中选择图片。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/picture.rst:20
msgid "Press **Open** button to add the picture."
msgstr "按 **打开** 按钮添加图片 。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/picture.rst:21
msgid ""
"Left click on the `workspace`_ area where the picture should be placed."
msgstr "左键点击 `工作区 <workspace_>`_ 区域，将图片放置在其中 。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/picture.rst:27
msgid ""
"If the `toolbar`_ is not displayed, it can be displayed from **Settings > "
"Display > Add**."
msgstr "如果 `工具栏 <toolbar_>`_ 不显示，可以从 **设置 > 显示 > Add** 显示。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/picture.rst:30
msgid "Resize picture"
msgstr "更改图片大小"

#: ../../source/users/schema/picture.rst:32
msgid "Right click on the picture."
msgstr "右键点击图片 。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/picture.rst:33
msgid "Select the option **Edit the image** to display the picture editor."
msgstr "选择选项 **编辑图像** 以显示图片编辑器 。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/picture.rst:34
msgid "Choose the size scale desired."
msgstr "选择想要的大小尺度 。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/picture.rst:35
msgid "Press **Apply** button to change the picture size."
msgstr "按 **Apply** 按钮更改图片大小。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/picture.rst:40
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech picture editor"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 图片编辑器"

#: ../../source/users/schema/picture.rst:44
msgid ""
"The picture editor can also be displayed with double click on the picture "
"using ``Ctrl + e`` shortcut keyboard."
msgstr "图片编辑器也可以使用 ``Ctrl + e`` 快捷键盘双击显示图片。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/picture.rst:47
msgid "Move picture"
msgstr "移动图片"

#: ../../source/users/schema/picture.rst:49
msgid "Left click on the picture."
msgstr "左键点击图片 。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/picture.rst:50
msgid "Move the picture without releasing the button."
msgstr "移动图片而不释放按钮 。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/picture.rst:54
msgid ""
"The position from the picture can be locked to prevent involuntary "
"movements, go to picture editor and check the **Lock Position** button."
msgstr "图片中的位置可以被锁定以防止非自愿移动，去图片编辑器并检查 **洛克位置** 按钮。"
